  "solution": "Logic : (1st number + 3rd number) × 5 = 2nd number\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• (4, 55, 7)\n\n**(4 + 7)**__ × 5 = 55\n\n__**11 × 5**__ = 55\n\n55 = 55 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (2, 35, 5)\n\n(2 + 5)__ × 5 = 35\n\n__7 × 5__ = 35\n\n35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 41, 156, 7\n\n(41 + 7)__ × 5 = 156\n\n__48 × 5__ = 156\n\n240 ≠ 156 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 12, 346, 9\n\n(12 + 9)__ × 5 = 346\n\n__21 × 5__ = 346\n\n105 ≠ 346 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 32, 175, 3\n\n(32 + 3)__ × 5 = 175\n\n__35 × 5__ = 175\n\n**175 = 175 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 19, 122, 8\n\n(19 + 8)__ × 5 = 122\n\n__27 × 5__ = 122\n\n135 ≠ 122 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
